OL,3,GNEWSAAirport runway project delayed
OL,4,Auntil 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major project to rebuild Alderney
OL,7,FAirport's ageing runway has been
OL,8,Fdelayed by at least a year, with
OL,9,Fconstruction now expected to begin in
OL,10,F2028 rather than 2027.
OL,12,FThe delay comes despite politicians
OL,13,Fapproving up to #24m for the scheme in
OL,14,FFebruary, when the States of Guernsey
OL,15,Fhad hoped work could start in 2027.
OL,17,FPolicy and Resources said further
OL,18,Fdesign work was needed after receiving
OL,19,Fregulatory advice and feedback from the
OL,20,FStates of Alderney.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
