OL,3,GNEWSAAirport runway project delayed
OL,4,Auntil 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe committee said: "Consequently, the
OL,7,Fdesign work means that the anticipated
OL,8,Fmilestones set out in the January 2026
OL,9,Fpolicy letter have been revised to
OL,10,Freflect this delay, ultimately meaning
OL,11,Fthat construction is now anticipated in
OL,12,F2028, rather than 2027."
